"STRING"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Capture urban elegance with this striking photograph featuring a modern apartment building in the background. The building showcases a unique architectural design with alternating pink and white stone facades, complemented by large, grid-patterned windows. In the foreground, a young woman with fair skin and dark brown, slightly wavy hair is partially visible, adding a personal touch to the scene. Her subtle, natural makeup enhances her relaxed, yet elegant appearance. The photograph beautifully balances the urban architecture with a touch of human presence, making it perfect for modern, city-inspired decor. Ideal for use in home galleries, office spaces, or as a conversation starter in living rooms.", "This captivating portrait features a young Asian woman with a delicate and serene expression. Her smooth, fair skin is beautifully highlighted by natural sunlight, and her dark brown hair is gently tousled, adding a touch of elegance. She wears subtle, natural makeup with a soft pink lip color. The background is softly blurred, focusing attention on her face, and includes a hint of greenery and a metallic structure, suggesting an outdoor setting. The overall style is minimalist and contemporary, perfect for those seeking a natural, elegant aesthetic. Ideal for use in promotional materials, social media profiles, or personal projects.", "Elegant portrait featuring a young woman with smooth, fair skin and delicate facial features. She has long, dark brown hair neatly pulled back, showcasing her clear, expressive brown eyes and subtle, natural makeup. Her lips are adorned with a soft, pinkish-red hue. She wears a pair of elegant, dangling earrings with turquoise and gold accents, adding a touch of sophistication. The background is softly blurred with green bamboo leaves, creating a serene, natural ambiance. This image exudes a timeless, classic beauty, perfect for use in promotional materials, advertisements, or as a decorative piece. Ideal for highlighting natural beauty and elegant accessories.", "This elegant women's kimono features a luxurious white fabric adorned with intricate floral embroidery in vibrant shades of red, blue, and green. The kimono's high collar and flowing sleeves provide a classic, sophisticated look, perfect for both casual and formal occasions. The soft, smooth texture of the fabric ensures comfort and durability. A delicate, turquoise teardrop earring adds a touch of timeless elegance, complementing the kimono's ornate design. Ideal for special events, cultural celebrations, or simply adding a touch of traditional beauty to your everyday style. The image showcases the kimono's upper body, highlighting its exquisite craftsmanship and stylish appeal.", "This elegant kimono features a beautifully intricate floral design in red, blue, and white on a soft white fabric. The kimono is adorned with a delicate, peach-colored sash embellished with matching floral patterns. The high-quality material ensures a smooth, comfortable wear, perfect for traditional or festive occasions. The model's red lipstick and turquoise earrings add a stylish touch, highlighting the kimono's sophisticated and timeless appeal. Ideal for special events or cultural celebrations, this kimono combines traditional beauty with modern elegance. Perfect for those looking to add a touch of classic Japanese style to their wardrobe.", "This elegant kimono features a soft white fabric adorned with intricate, colorful floral embroidery in shades of blue, red, and orange. The kimono's wide sleeves are gracefully draped, adding a touch of traditional Japanese style. The inner lining is a warm, peachy-orange, providing a subtle contrast to the outer fabric. The obi (sash) is a complementary tan color, tied neatly at the waist. Perfect for special occasions or adding a cultural touch to everyday wear, this kimono combines timeless design with vibrant detail. Ideal for those who appreciate traditional craftsmanship and modern elegance.", "This elegant kimono-style robe features a luxurious cream-colored fabric adorned with intricate, colorful floral patterns in red, blue, and green. The robe has wide, flowing sleeves with a subtle blue trim and a decorative gold border. The soft, smooth texture of the fabric ensures comfort and a refined appearance. Perfect for special occasions or everyday relaxation, this robe combines traditional Japanese design with modern sophistication. Ideal for those looking to add a touch of cultural elegance to their wardrobe. Hand wash recommended for best results."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 202, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [533.4420776367188, 383.80572509765625], "pos": [2486.125244140625, 2098.819580078125], "id": 77, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "links": [197], "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["fancyfeast/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava", "nf4", "cuda"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [453.6000061035156, 106], "pos": [1589.6331787109375, 1921.77734375], "id": 136, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {"quantization_mode": true, "model": true, "device": true}, "aux_id": "chflame163/ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [70, 205], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name"